  Tested      Approved by the owner 2026-11-07; run by script through the real
              loader in JNext 1.1.104 on a NextZXOS card copy, default and all
              eight cheats

  Replay      IDENTICAL on 11,500 recorded frames (town and duel): at every
              hook original and patched code compared from the same state,
              every register with R and the original's RAM; 5 deliberately
              broken builds rejected

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: 18 pace trials, 17 frozen states
              matching the original's picture and RAM exactly, beeper writes
              at the original clock (5,650 pulses compared), a 12,000-frame
              restart soak; the real loader (.NEXCLASH) on a private card copy

  Coverage    Recordings and soaks by script, no human play: menu, town,
              duels, deaths, game over and restart; not reached: natural
              completion, joysticks

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
